INTENDED USE
------------

QICOM is intended for research and quality-assessment use only. It is not a
medical device, and it is not intended for clinical diagnosis or for any
decision concerning the care of a patient.


DICOM ATTRIBUTION
-----------------

QICOM supports DICOM® medical images.

DICOM® is the registered trademark of the National Electrical Manufacturers
Association (NEMA) for its standards publications relating to digital
communications of medical information.

QICOM is an independent software project and is not affiliated with,
sponsored by, or endorsed by NEMA or the DICOM Standards Committee.

QICOM reads DICOM files; it implements no DICOM network or storage service,
claims no conformance to the DICOM Standard, and publishes no DICOM
Conformance Statement.


