BUNDLED MODEL
-------------

QICOM bundles, unmodified, the RIQE reference model riqe-v1.0
(qicom/metrics/models/riqe-v1.0.npz, doi:10.5281/zenodo.23055559), released
under CC BY 4.0 and fitted on the TCIA collection LDCT-and-Projection-data
(doi:10.7937/9npb-2637, CC BY 4.0). Its licence and the attributions it
requires are in notices/RIQE-MODEL.txt (next to this file in a desktop bundle),
in qicom/metrics/models/RIQE-MODEL.txt (next to the model in an installed
package) and in packaging/notices/ in the source tree.
